BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Village Next to Paradise
DTSTART:20250519T220000Z
DTEND:20250520T002500Z
DTSTAMP:20250519T220000Z
UID:sxZvTgOClk
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 133 mins (2h13m)\n\nIn the first Somali film ever se
 lected for the Cannes Film Festival\, a villager and his sister are just t
 rying to make ends meet and send his son off to boarding school. But in a 
 world defined by chaos\, unease\, and civil unrest\, sometimes sacrifice i
 s the only answer. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/the-vill
 age-next-to-paradise\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Film Center (Wed 21 M
 ay\, 5:30 PM)
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Gloria of your Imagination
DTSTART:20250520T010000Z
DTEND:20250520T025000Z
DTSTAMP:20250520T010000Z
UID:W1pUEBgSJd
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 98 mins (1h38m)\n\nIn 1964\, a 30-year-old divorced 
 woman named Gloria was filmed consulting with three eminent therapists. Fi
 lmmaker Jennifer Reeves uses this footage to explore single parenthood\, g
 endered power relationships\, and Gloria’s remarkable story. Director Je
 nnifer Reeves and co-producer Randy Sterns scheduled to attend. Attend the
  May 20 screening to meet filmmaker Caryn Cline\, get a free zine from Int
 erbay Cinema Society\, and learn about the upcoming Engauge Experimental F
 ilm Festival. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/the-gloria-of
 -your-imagination\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Film Center (Tue 20 May\
 , 3:30 PM)\n\nFilm is also being streamed.
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Unclickable
DTSTART:20250520T033000Z
DTEND:20250520T045500Z
DTSTAMP:20250520T033000Z
UID:wS1S7P7rKD
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 74 mins (1h14m)\n\nIn this investigative documentary
  ripped from the headlines\, follow the creation and devastating impact of
  a digital advertising fraud operation\, the likes of which enriches compa
 nies like Google and Facebook at the cost of everybody else…and democrac
 y itself. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/unclickable\n\nAl
 so playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3 (Thu 22 May\, 1:30 PM)\n\
 nFilm is also being streamed.
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
