SUMMARY:Joqtau
DTSTART:20250523T010000Z
DTEND:20250523T022500Z
DTSTAMP:20250523T010000Z
UID:VpVXeQbm10
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 71 mins (1h11m)\n\nYoung Darkhan returns to his vill
 age after a seven-year absence to accompany his late grandfather on an ima
 gined journey to his ancestral home to learn the ways of his elders and th
 e gradual loss of their traditional customs and language. Sponsored by:\n\
 nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/joqtau\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cine
 ma Uptown House 3 (Tue 20 May\, 12:45 PM)\n\nFilm is also being streamed.
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
